During the 1967–68 Scottish football season, [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] competed in the [[Scottish Division One]].<ref>[https://thecelticstar.com/celtic-win-in-last-ten-seconds-david-potter-on-the-year-after-the-year-before/ Celtic Win in Last Ten Seconds – David Potter on The Year After the Year Before], The Celtic Star, 15 November 2019</ref>

